1731
02:25:03,640 --> 02:25:04,660
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Yes, Sir Francis.

1732
02:25:05,020 --> 02:25:06,900
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Apologies, Mr. Secretary. Please respond.

1733
02:25:06,900 --> 02:25:11,940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Yung, yung, yung pong katapusan ng 27, yung kahihinatnan,

1734
02:25:13,380 --> 02:25:15,340
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: inaamin ko po, wala po sa aking kamay.

1735
02:25:16,180 --> 02:25:17,580
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Wala po sa aming kamay.

1736
02:25:18,260 --> 02:25:22,160
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Dahil hindi natin alam kung ano mangyayari doon sa Supreme Court decision din.

1737
02:25:22,920 --> 02:25:26,420
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi po natin alam din, hindi, uulitin ko, hindi ko naman kilala yung,

1738
02:25:26,620 --> 02:25:28,560
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ah, RTC Judge.

1739
02:25:28,680 --> 02:25:31,600
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Nung nag-file po ako, hindi ko alam kung nandun po siya.

1740
02:25:31,760 --> 02:25:34,740
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Nung nag-file po ako ng motion for reconsideration,

1741
02:25:35,000 --> 02:25:38,660
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: at wala naman po siguro akong karapatan, nakausapin ng juez.

1742
02:25:39,400 --> 02:25:44,520
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So, your Honor, ginagawa po natin lahat ang pamamaraan

1743
02:25:44,520 --> 02:25:50,280
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: para nang sa ganun ay maibigay sa mga manggagawang Pilipino dito sa Metro Manila

1744
02:25:50,280 --> 02:25:56,540
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: yung nararapat sa kanilang umento na hindi lumalabag po sa batas.

1745
02:25:56,620 --> 02:26:02,380
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: At, ah, uulitin ko, yung husgado ay hindi po natin kontrolado.

1746
02:26:02,500 --> 02:26:05,380
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kung ganun katagal yan, hindi ko po masagot.

1747
02:26:05,840 --> 02:26:11,780
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Subalit, yung nasa saklaw ng, ah, umiiral na Labor Code of the Philippines,

1748
02:26:12,400 --> 02:26:19,240
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: eh, hindi po, hindi po siguro dapat, ah, sabihin natin ngayon na hindi dapat gumalaw

1749
02:26:19,240 --> 02:26:24,020
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: yung ating mga wage boards at gumagalaw naman po sila patungkol po dito.

1750
02:26:24,020 --> 02:26:26,520
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: And, and likewise, ah, your Honor, siguro,

1751
02:26:26,620 --> 02:26:32,720
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: maunawaan natin that there should be a stop on the filing of these TROs.

1752
02:26:33,500 --> 02:26:38,920
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: They should be a halt, not a pause, ah, not through a court order,

1753
02:26:39,080 --> 02:26:46,960
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: but the court should realize na bali talaga yun, na hindi dapat nila pigilin sa, yung, yung saklawan.

1754
02:26:47,460 --> 02:26:52,620
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ah, isang beses lang po nangyari yan sa, sa bayan po ng ating kaibigan din,

1755
02:26:52,620 --> 02:26:55,420
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na yung mauna, si Senator Boy Herrera sa Bohol,

1756
