4777
05:47:54,410 --> 05:47:55,770
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: yung 2027.

4778
05:47:55,790 --> 05:47:57,670
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: budget priorities nila.

4779
05:47:57,950 --> 05:48:00,550
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Number one pa rin is human capital development.

4780
05:48:01,350 --> 05:48:17,090
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: And nakalagay po doon, foster the dynamic, inclusive, and responsive labor market while addressing digital upskilling and reskilling initiatives under the Trabajo para sa Bayan Plan 2025-2034.

4781
05:48:17,270 --> 05:48:21,030
