4793
05:49:14,460 --> 05:49:20,180
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Gusto ko lang pong malaman sa inyo first hand kung talaga bang seryoso po ito kaya ako po naitanong.

4794
05:49:21,140 --> 05:49:25,240
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Anyway po, I still have a lot of questions to ask.

4795
05:49:25,240 --> 05:49:27,420
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Pero hindi ko na po itatanong.

4796
05:49:27,420 --> 05:49:34,240
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Let me just siguro po manifest that naiintindihan ko po ang kalagayan natin.

4797
05:49:34,800 --> 05:49:39,780
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ang challenge na meron sa atin sa panahon ngayon lalo po sa inyo sa DOLE at sa TESDA.

4798
05:49:40,620 --> 05:49:44,420
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kaya po, nandiyan dyan po yung unemployment na tumataas.

4799
05:49:45,420 --> 05:49:48,180
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Couple that, add to that yung global uncertainties.

4800
05:49:48,900 --> 05:49:53,140
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: And of course, the urgent need to protect our workers both here and abroad.

4801
05:49:53,140 --> 05:49:56,180
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kaya kami po sa kababaihan, kabalikatan.

4802
05:49:56,180 --> 05:50:04,180
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Para sa kapakanan at kaunlaran ng bayan or 4K, ay nag-i-extend po sa inyo ng wholehearted support.

4803
05:50:05,260 --> 05:50:14,360
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Para maipagpatuloy po ninyo ang vital mission ninyo to safeguard labor rights and creating opportunities for our people.

4804
05:50:14,740 --> 05:50:17,880
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Especially po sa ating mga kababaihan.

4805
05:50:18,660 --> 05:50:25,180
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So, lalo na po ngayon, Mr. Chair, tapusin ko na lamang po itong Mexico Manifestation.

4806
05:50:25,180 --> 05:50:34,580
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: At the same time, yung aming pong support comes with it a call that every peso entrusted to DOLE must be spent wisely, transparently, and strategically.

4807
05:50:35,240 --> 05:50:40,920
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: The Filipino workforce is our nation's greatest asset and our most valuable export.

4808
05:50:41,360 --> 05:50:50,980
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kaya tinihiling po natin sa DOLE na lalo pang pagbutihin ang kanilang mga programa upang ang ating mga manggagawa ay maging mas handa,

4809
05:50:50,980 --> 05:50:54,300
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: mas protectado, at maging mas competitive po.

4810
05:50:55,180 --> 05:50:56,940
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Sa harap ng pandaigdigang hamon.

4811
05:50:57,400 --> 05:51:02,940
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: In these difficult times, we stand with DOLE, but we also challenge it to do better, to rise higher,

4812
05:51:03,160 --> 05:51:11,560
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: and to ensure that the 2027 budget truly translates into jobs, dignity, and hope for millions of Filipino workers.

4813
05:51:11,740 --> 05:51:18,580
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair. Maraming salamat po, Secretary Tolentino, Secretary Benitez, and to the whole DOLE family.

